---
import type { CollectionEntry } from "astro:content";
import menu from "@/config/menu.json";
import Faq from "../components/Faq.astro";
import "../../styles/pages/exited-founders.css";

interface Props {
  content: CollectionEntry<"pages">["data"];
}

const { content } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="sn-hero sn-exited-hero p-0 text-cream">
  <div class="sn-exited-hero-inner box-border flex min-h-[clamp(440px,68vw,780px)] items-center px-[clamp(20px,4vw,32px)] pt-[clamp(64px,10vw,128px)] pb-[clamp(72px,11vw,136px)] max-[640px]:min-h-0 max-[640px]:bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(20,18,14,.94),rgba(20,18,14,.72))]">
    <div class="max-w-[1160px] w-full mx-auto my-0 relative" style="z-index: 1">
      <div class="max-w-[720px] flex flex-col gap-[clamp(16px,3vw,28px)]">
        <p
          class="m-0 text-[14px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#F5C400]"
          >{content.hero.eyebrow}</p
        >
        <h1
          class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[clamp(36px,5vw,64px)] leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] text-balance"
          >{content.hero.title}</h1
        >
        <p class="m-0 text-[clamp(17px,2.6vw,21px)] leading-[1.5] text-[#E6DFCF]"
          >{content.hero.description}</p
        >
        {
          content.hero.cta && (
            <div
              class="flex flex-wrap items-center mt-[8px]"
              style="gap: 16px 24px"
            >
              <a
                href={content.hero.cta.href}
                style="background: rgb(245, 196, 0); color: rgb(20, 18, 14); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; padding: 17px 28px; border-radius: 6px"
              >
                {content.hero.cta.label}
              </a>
              {content.hero.cta.note && (
                <span class="text-[15px]" style="color: rgb(230, 223, 207)">
                  {content.hero.cta.note}
                </span>
              )}
            </div>
          )
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <img
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
    class="sn-burst sn-burst-l"
    src="/assets/star-lines-4dde23efecf3.png"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
  />
  <img
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
    class="sn-burst sn-burst-r"
    src="/assets/star-lines-4dde23efecf3.png"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
  />
</section>

<section
  style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #14120E; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3DCCB; padding: 104px 32px"
>
  <div
    class="max-w-[1160px] mx-auto my-0 grid items-start"
    style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(420px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-[28px]"
      ><h2
        class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[clamp(36px,4.4vw,56px)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#14120E]"
        >Fewer than 1% of entrepreneurs exit. You did. <span
          style="color: rgb(245, 196, 0)">;-)</span
        > Now <br />pay-it-forward.</h2
      >
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center" style="gap: 10px 16px"
        ><img
          class="h-[56px] w-auto block"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          src="/assets/founder-avatars-1d615053384a.png"
          alt="Four exited founders from the Supernova network"
        /><span
          class="[font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[15px] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase"
          >250+ exited founders. One team.</span
        ></div
      >
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-[20px] text-[18px] text-[#3A362D]">
      <p class="m-0"
        >Every exited founder at Supernova advises, invests, or both. You
        probably already do as well.</p
      >
      <p class="m-0"
        >So we made it a thing. Supernova makes sure you find the founder who
        benefits most from having you in their corner.</p
      >
      <p class="m-0"
        >You know startups are a shit show. Even the best startups backed by the
        best. That's why we do it better together. When exited founders play as
        a team, we shore up each other's gaps.</p
      >
      <p
        style="margin: 4px 0; padding: 4px 0 4px 20px; border-left: 4px solid #F5C400; font-weight: 600; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; color: #14120E"
        >Every one of us has regrets and would-haves, could-haves and
        should-haves. And we have earned battle-tested <span
          style="background: linear-gradient(transparent 58%, rgb(245, 196, 0) 58%); padding: 0px 2px"
          >wisdom</span
        >, experience, relationships and networks that are super valuable to
        other founders.</p
      >
      <p class="m-0"
        >Help us help them suffer less and achieve better outcomes.</p
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding: 104px 32px">
  <div class="max-w-[1160px] mx-auto my-0 flex flex-col gap-[40px]">
    <h2
      class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[44px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em]"
      >Supernova is where exited founders build together.</h2
    >
    <div
      class="grid gap-[20px]"
      style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(250px, 100%), 1fr))"
    >
      <div
        style="background: #4DA6F0; color: #14120E; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"
      >
        <span
          class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#14120E]"
          >Compensation</span
        >
        <h3
          class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[26px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em]"
          >Every role is paid</h3
        >
        <p class="m-0 text-[15px] text-[#3A362D]"
          >Equity or cash distributions for the work you do. You don't have to
          invest to join.</p
        >
      </div>
      <div
        style="background: #5ED4DE; color: #14120E; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"
      >
        <span
          class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#14120E]"
          >Deal flow</span
        >
        <h3
          class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[26px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em]"
          >Founders worth seeing</h3
        >
        <p class="m-0 text-[15px] text-[#3A362D]"
          >Growth-stage companies scored by NOVA AI before they reach your
          inbox.</p
        >
      </div>
      <div
        style="background: #F2C94C; color: #14120E; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"
      >
        <span
          class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#14120E]"
          >Peers</span
        >
        <h3
          class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[26px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em]"
          >250+ who've done it</h3
        >
        <p class="m-0 text-[15px] text-[#3A362D]"
          >A room where everyone has built, scaled and sold.</p
        >
      </div>
      <div
        style="background: #EE8E86; color: #14120E; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"
      >
        <span
          class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#14120E]"
          >Choice</span
        >
        <h3
          class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[26px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em]"
          >You opt in</h3
        >
        <p class="m-0 text-[15px] text-[#3A362D]"
          >We match you to companies that need your precedent. You say yes or
          pass. Either is fine.</p
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section
  style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #FFFFFF; border-top: 1px solid #E3DCCB; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3DCCB; padding: 112px 32px"
>
  <img
    class="absolute left-0 h-auto pointer-events-none top-1/2 w-[min(34vw,440px)] -translate-x-[38%] -translate-y-1/2"
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
    src="/assets/ring-lines-26c73d2f4368.png"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
  />
  <figure
    class="relative max-w-[940px] mx-auto my-0 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-[28px]"
  >
    <span
      class="[font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[96px] leading-[0.6] text-[#F5C400] h-[44px]"
      aria-hidden="true">“</span
    >
    <blockquote
      class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[clamp(28px,3.8vw,48px)] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance"
      >Supernova eliminates the friction between wanting to help founders and
      actually making it happen. That's exactly what I've found with them, a way
      to meaningfully help without wasting time.</blockquote
    >
    <figcaption
      class="flex flex-col gap-[6px] text-[13px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[#5E584C]"
      ><span class="font-semibold text-[#14120E]">Aly Orady</span><span
        >Founder and former CEO, Tonal</span
      ></figcaption
    >
  </figure>
</section>

<section style="background: #0A090D; color: #FAF5EA; padding: 104px 32px">
  <div class="max-w-[1160px] mx-auto my-0 flex flex-col gap-[clamp(36px,6vw,72px)]">
    <div
      class="grid items-center"
      style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(420px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-[20px]">
        <span
          class="text-[14px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#F5C400]"
          >EXITED FOUNDER PLATFORM</span
        >
        <h2
          class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[clamp(36px,4.4vw,56px)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em]"
          >We match you to the founder who needs you in their corner.</h2
        >
        <p class="m-0 text-[19px] text-[#E6DFCF]"
          >Tell Stargate who you are and who you want to help. It matches you
          where you can add the most value now.</p
        >
        <p class="m-0 text-[16px] text-[#CFC7B6]"
          >You stay in control. No introduction is made without your approval.</p
        >
      </div>
      <img
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        src="/assets/stargate-gate-4d58b71dddcb.jpg"
        alt="The Stargate login screen: a stone gateway with the words Welcome, Superstar"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block"
      />
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid items-start"
      style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(420px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px"
    >
      <img
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        src="/assets/stargate-prefs-47a5587233ff.jpg"
        alt="Stargate preferences screen showing engagement types, bandwidth and startup stage choices"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #2E2A22; display: block"
      />
      <ol
        style="margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column"
      >
        <li
          style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #2E2A22"
          ><span
            class="text-[13px] font-semibold"
            style="color: rgb(245, 196, 0)">01</span
          ><span
            class="[font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[1.2]"
            >Your profile and superpowers</span
          ><span class="text-[16px]" style="color: rgb(230, 223, 207)"
            >Your exits, your functions, the things you are unreasonably good
            at.&nbsp;</span
          ></li
        >
        <li
          style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #2E2A22"
          ><span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#F5C400]">02</span><span
            class="[font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[1.2]"
            >The founders you want to help</span
          ><span class="text-[16px] text-[#E6DFCF]"
            >Pick the stages, sectors and geographies you care about.</span
          ><ul
            style="margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px"
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Seed</li
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Series A</li
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Series B</li
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Series C+</li
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Exit readiness</li
            ></ul
          ></li
        >
        <li
          style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #2E2A22"
          ><span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#F5C400]">03</span><span
            class="[font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[1.2]"
            >The role you want</span
          ><span class="text-[16px] text-[#E6DFCF]"
            >Choose how you show up, then set your bandwidth, from monthly calls
            to full-time embedded.</span
          ><ul
            style="margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px"
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Board member</li
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Advisory role</li
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Hands-on operating partner</li
            ><li
              style="border: 1px solid #C9A227; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: #F5E7A8"
              >Fractional role</li
            ></ul
          ></li
        >
        <li
          style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #2E2A22"
          ><span
            class="text-[13px] font-semibold"
            style="color: rgb(245, 196, 0)">04</span
          ><span
            class="[font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[1.2]"
            >We match you</span
          ><span class="text-[16px]" style="color: rgb(230, 223, 207)"
            >NOVA AI finds the company where you can add the most value
            now.&nbsp;</span
          ></li
        >
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="h-[56px]"></div>

