        <h2
          class="m-0 [font-family:'Space_Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[clamp(36px,4.4vw,56px)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em]"
          >250+ exited founders.&nbsp;</h2
        >
      </div>
      <p class="m-0 text-[18px] text-[#3A362D]"
        >If you've built, scaled, and sold, this is where exited founders
        advise, invest, and build together.</p
      >
    </div>
    <div class="sn-exited-founder-grid grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(200px,100%),1fr))] gap-x-2.5 gap-y-9 max-[640px]:grid-cols-2 max-[640px]:gap-x-3 max-[640px]:gap-y-6">
      <article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"
        ><img
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="sn-face"
          src="/assets/barry-stamos-be3434c5bd8b.png"
          alt="Barry Stamos"
          style="aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; border-radius: 6px; display: block"
        /><div
          style="flex: 1; background: #EFE8D8; border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 14px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"
